Description: Aurora router panel (formerly "VLESS on the router") for OpenWrt (uhttpd :8088).
 Toggle transparent proxy, test connection and speed, save vless://,
 hysteria2://, naive+https:// links and a WireGuard .conf, and
 autoupdate each protocol from its own saved connection link (when it is
 an http(s) subscription URL). Requires a manually
 installed xray binary in /usr/bin and geoip/geosite in /usr/share/xray.
 hysteria and naive binaries are optional; install naive with /usr/libexec/aurora-panel/install-naive.sh.
